    count: 5
    what: "xtask/tests/gate0_cache.rs: worktree_key invalidation contract — identical tree stable; tracked edit, whitespace edit, and a new untracked source file each change the key; a gitignored artifact does not (the load-bearing invariant: a stale green can never yield a skip)."
  unit:
    count: 3
    what: "xtask::gate0 cache round-trip — absent cache reads none; a stored key round-trips and lives under target/; a different key is a miss."
